OL,3,ACatherine says nature can help
OL,4,Achildren's emotional growth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess of Wales has launched a
OL,7,Fproject promoting the use of nature to
OL,8,Fhelp develop young children's social
OL,9,Fand emotional development.
OL,11,F"Nature is such an extraordinary
OL,12,Fenvironment for us all and, in this
OL,13,Ftech-driven, digital age, spending
OL,14,Fquality time outdoors has never been
OL,15,Fmore important," says Catherine, in a
OL,16,Fsocial media post.
OL,18,FThis is the latest stage in Catherine's
OL,19,Fcampaign to improve the status of early
OL,20,Fyears education and to find ways to
OL,21,Fimprove children's wellbeing.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
