OL,3,ACatherine says nature can help
OL,4,Achildren's emotional growth
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe says that research has shown "just
OL,7,Fhow important nature is for our
OL,8,Fpsychological and physiological
OL,9,Fwellbeing".
